# The functions that run a model, `embed`, `embed_tokens` and `rerank`, exist only in a build with
# embedding support and answer from weights installed on the machine, so no case can grade what
# they return. What every build agrees on is that a call with the wrong number of arguments is
# refused: a build with the feature says so, and a build without it says the feature is not built.
# The `rerank` capability row is exercised by that refusal.

oracle none

case capability-rerank
capability rerank

statement error
SELECT rerank('only one argument')
